{"seq":3,"slug":"change-management-drill-sla-metric","title":"变更管理、故障演练与路由 SLA/容量度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/bgp-interdomain-routing-anycast-peering-edge-traffic-engineering/operations-security-observability/change-management-drill-sla-metric","wordCount":2794,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"变更管理-故障演练与路由-sla-容量度量\">变更管理、故障演练与路由 SLA/容量度量</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-路由运维的三条咬合闭环\">核心概念：路由运维的三条咬合闭环</h2><p>BGP 是全网的协议，没有&quot;灰度发布&quot;这种奢侈品。一条 UPDATE 发出几秒内就出现在 RouteViews 和几万个 AS 的 Adj-RIB-In 里，撤回它不会让已完成的转发生效——那段窗口的流量已经丢了。所以域间路由运维靠三条互相咬合的闭环：<strong>变更管理</strong>（谁有权改、改前验证什么、改错用什么退回去）、<strong>故障演练</strong>（主动制造收敛、泄露、断链，把恢复时间量成分布而非感觉）、<strong>SLA 与容量度量</strong>（把&quot;网络是好的&quot;翻译成可报警、可追责的数字）。三者共用同一批数据源——BMP 采集的 RIB 与 UPDATE 流——构成一台度量飞轮：变更留证据，演练产分布，SLA 判真伪。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  CHG[变更管理&lt;br/&gt;预检 / 窗口 / 回滚] --&gt;|变更前后 RIB diff| OBS[可观测数据面&lt;br/&gt;BMP RFC 7854 + Loc-RIB RFC 9069]&#10;  DRL[故障演练&lt;br/&gt;收敛 / 泄露 / 断链] --&gt;|注入与恢复时间序列| OBS&#10;  OBS --&gt;|前缀可达率 / 收敛 P95 / 路径变更数| SLA[SLA 与容量度量]&#10;  SLA --&gt;|阈值击穿 → 触发演练| DRL&#10;  SLA --&gt;|余量不足 → 扩容或冻结| CHG&#10;  OBS --&gt;|基线告警| CHG\">graph TD\n  CHG[变更管理&lt;br/&gt;预检 / 窗口 / 回滚] --&gt;|变更前后 RIB diff| OBS[可观测数据面&lt;br/&gt;BMP RFC 7854 + Loc-RIB RFC 9069]\n  DRL[故障演练&lt;br/&gt;收敛 / 泄露 / 断链] --&gt;|注入与恢复时间序列| OBS\n  OBS --&gt;|前缀可达率 / 收敛 P95 / 路径变更数| SLA[SLA 与容量度量]\n  SLA --&gt;|阈值击穿 → 触发演练| DRL\n  SLA --&gt;|余量不足 → 扩容或冻结| CHG\n  OBS --&gt;|基线告警| CHG</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>闭环</th>\n<th>触发</th>\n<th>核心输入</th>\n<th>交付物</th>\n<th>典型失败模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>变更管理</td>\n<td>业务/容量需求</td>\n<td>配置 diff、IRR/RPKI 状态</td>\n<td>变更记录 + 回滚点</td>\n<td>预检漏项 → 前缀被判 Invalid 黑洞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>故障演练</td>\n<td>季度节奏 / SLA 击穿</td>\n<td>演练剧本、测试前缀</td>\n<td>恢复时间分布</td>\n<td>只练&quot;温柔&quot;场景 → 真实故障超时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SLA/容量度量</td>\n<td>持续</td>\n<td>BMP / telemetry 流</td>\n<td>阈值告警 + 余量曲线</td>\n<td>指标定义与用户感知脱节</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键前提是：<strong>三条闭环共享同一份&quot;路由真相&quot;</strong>。若 RIB 采集有延迟、或只采 Adj-RIB-In 而看不到本地选路结果，变更 diff 就不可信、演练测不准、SLA 也失去意义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"路由变更管理-预检-优雅下线与可回滚提交\">路由变更管理：预检、优雅下线与可回滚提交</h2><p>变更前的三项预检：<strong>来源授权一致性</strong>——新前缀是否已在 IRR 登记 <code>route:</code> / <code>route6:</code>、是否签出覆盖该掩码的 ROA；同一前缀用多 ASN 宣告时必须为每个合法起源 AS 各签一条 ROA（见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../peering-transit-policy-rpki/rpki-roa-irr-origin-validation\">RPKI/ROA、IRR 源认证与泄露劫持防护合规</a>）。<strong>过滤与容量余量</strong>——确认对端掩码上限（社区实践 IPv4 /24、IPv6 /48，RFC 7454 §6.1.3）与本端 max-prefix 剩余空间。<strong>影响面枚举</strong>——这次改动改变哪些对等方的优选路径、是否影响 community 打标（见 <a href=\"../peering-transit-policy-rpki/import-export-policy-community-tagging\">导入导出策略与 community 打标</a>）。</p>\n<p>路由变更的风险不在命令本身，而在它对<strong>收敛</strong>与<strong>过滤</strong>的连锁效应。一条宣告改动会被沿途至少四道闸门裁决：对端的 prefix filter、RPKI 起源验证、IRR 生成的 prefix-list、max-prefix 上限。任意一道不通过，结果都不是&quot;变慢&quot;而是&quot;整个前缀不可达&quot;。第一原则因此是：<strong>把每条宣告改动当成一次会被多道外部策略裁决的提交</strong>。</p>\n<p>拆会话或撤前缀前应先&quot;预告离开&quot;而非硬断。IETF 定义了两层机制：<strong>RFC 8326《Graceful BGP Session Shutdown》</strong>（2018-03）定义 well-known community <code>GRACEFUL_SHUTDOWN</code>（值 <code>0xFFFF0000</code>），对端收到后本地偏好降为最低，把流量切到备用路径后再断；<strong>RFC 8203《BGP Administrative Shutdown Communication》</strong>（2017-07）允许在 Cease NOTIFICATION 里带最多 128 字节 UTF-8 文本说明原因。多数实现把两者合成 maintenance mode：进入后自动打 graceful shutdown community、保持会话存活直到流量排空。窗口选择还要看<strong>目标市场时区</strong>——对东南亚站点，香港时间凌晨 3 点对应印尼/越南低谷；对拉美站点应避开巴西晚间；支付与物流 API 的调用高峰同样是隐性约束。</p>\n<p>配置层的可回滚性决定 MTTR 下限。主流厂商都提供延迟确认：Juniper 的 <code>commit confirmed &lt;minutes&gt;</code>、Cisco IOS-XR 的 rollback 配置点、Nokia SR-OS 的配置回滚文件，语义均为&quot;先应用，若 N 分钟内未再确认则自动回退&quot;。流程应规定：<strong>涉及宣告增删的变更必须使用延迟确认，窗口不小于运维往返时延加一轮 BMP 采样周期</strong>，典型 10 分钟足以让误宣告在被发现前自动消失；配置归档（Cisco <code>archive</code>、Junos <code>rescue</code>）保证回退点数周后仍可复现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"故障演练-主动制造收敛-泄露与劫持\">故障演练：主动制造收敛、泄露与劫持</h2><p>演练的价值在于把&quot;我们觉得能恢复&quot;变成&quot;上周三实测恢复用了 47 秒&quot;。路由演练必须用<strong>保留测试前缀</strong>——RFC 5737 保留了 <code>192.0.2.0/24</code>、<code>198.51.100.0/24</code>、<code>203.0.113.0/24</code>——绝不能拿生产前缀做实验。工具链上，注入侧用 <code>exabgp</code> 或测试路由器策略注入，观测侧用 RIPE Atlas 探针、bgp.tools、BGPStream/RIS Live 流。\n演练要覆盖从&quot;温柔&quot;到&quot;恶性&quot;的谱系。最该练的是 <strong>路由泄露（route leak）</strong>：RFC 7908（2016-06）把泄露定义为&quot;不符合商业关系地传播路由&quot;，给出六类——发夹回环全前缀、横向 ISP-ISP-ISP、向对等方泄露上级前缀、向上级泄露对等前缀、用合法起源做前缀重起源、意外泄露内部与更具体前缀。演练时在隔离测试 AS 注入其中一类，再用多点探针观测前缀可达率是否跌破阈值；跌破且非预期即为真缺陷，需根因分析后补丁规则或配置，未跌破则记录恢复时间进入分布统计。恢复时间要按分布看。单次测得的收敛时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>reach</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>inject</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_c = t_{\\text{reach}} - t_{\\text{inject}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reach</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">inject</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是随机变量，取决于故障类型、BGP 定时器（MRAI 最小路由通告间隔默认 30 秒）与对端收敛速度。工程上应统计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>50</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{50}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">50</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>95</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{95}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">95</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与最大值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mn>95</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi>inf</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>∣</mo><mi>Pr</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mn>0.95</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{c}^{(P95)} = \\inf\\{ t \\mid \\Pr(T_c \\le t) \\ge 0.95 \\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.185em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">95</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">in<span style=\"margin-right:0.0778em;\">f</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">Pr</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.95</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只盯均值会掩盖长尾——一次 20 分钟的收敛和 100 次 5 秒的收敛，均值可能&quot;达标&quot;，但用户感知到的是那次 20 分钟。这也解释了抖动抑制（flap dampening）为何要谨慎：RFC 7454 §7 要求用调整后的阈值而非旧默认值（见 <a href=\"../bgp-topology-bestpath/convergence-route-flap-aggregation\">路由收敛、抖动抑制与前缀聚合</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>演练剧本</th>\n<th>注入方式</th>\n<th>观测目标</th>\n<th>常见超时原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>对等链路断开</td>\n<td>关闭接口 / 断 BGP 会话</td>\n<td>备用路径接管时间</td>\n<td>备用路径无 ROA / 被过滤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路由泄露</td>\n<td>测试 AS 注入越权传播</td>\n<td>最优路径是否被抢</td>\n<td>无 AS_PATH 过滤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优雅下线</td>\n<td>宣告 GRACEFUL_SHUTDOWN</td>\n<td>排空后再断是否零丢包</td>\n<td>对端未实现该 community</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"路由-sla-与容量度量-把-网络好-变成数字\">路由 SLA 与容量度量：把&quot;网络好&quot;变成数字</h2><p>路由 SLA 的难点是&quot;可用性&quot;在域间语境下没有唯一含义：用户侧的可用性是端到端可达，而你能直接控制的是<strong>前缀层可达性</strong>与<strong>路径稳定性</strong>。应把 SLA 拆成三个可独立采集、独立负责的指标族。</p>\n<p><strong>可达性</strong>：以全球分布式探针对每个对外宣告前缀的采样为准，定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>prefixes</mtext></mrow></munder><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>t</mi></munder><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>reachable</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>prefixes</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A = \\frac{\\sum_{p \\in \\text{prefixes}} \\sum_{t} \\mathbf{1}[\\text{reachable}(p,t)]}{|\\text{prefixes}| \\cdot |T|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5118em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5758em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">prefixes</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8258em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1864em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">prefixes</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1308em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reachable</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>采集源可以是 RIPE Atlas、站点真实用户的 RUM 数据，或第三方（ThousandEyes、Catchpoint）的 BGP 层监测。<strong>路径稳定性</strong>：单位时间内某前缀优选路径的变更次数与 AS_PATH 平均长度波动——频繁翻转往往指向对端策略抖动或本端 MED/LOCAL_PREF 不稳，是&quot;未来故障&quot;的先行指标。<strong>收敛时间</strong>：演练测得的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 分布落在滚动窗口的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>95</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{95}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">95</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>容量度量是另一半。IPv4 全球路由表近年已穿越百万条量级（实时数字见 bgp.potaroo.net 与 cidr-report.org），IPv6 表小一个数量级但增长更快。这个数字决定设备选型与 <code>max-prefix</code>：<strong>对等方的上限应低于全表规模，向上级（full-routing upstream）的上限应高于当前全表并留至少 20%–30% 余量</strong>（RFC 7454 §8）。余量不足的后果是：当全球表因一次大规模泄露突然膨胀 5%–10% 时，会话因超限被重置，你从&quot;部分路径变差&quot;跌到&quot;整条会话掉线&quot;。另一项常被低估的是 <strong>RPKI ROV 的资源开销</strong>：路由器要为每条路由维护校验状态表并随 RP 缓存器更新而重算，既占内存也占控制平面 CPU。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>采集源</th>\n<th>建议阈值（示例）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前缀可达率 A</td>\n<td>分布式探针可达采样占比</td>\n<td>RIPE Atlas / RUM</td>\n<td>≥ 99.9%（按市场分别计算）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收敛 P95</td>\n<td>故障到恢复时间的 95 分位</td>\n<td>BMP / RIS Live</td>\n<td>≤ 120 秒</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>路径变更次数</td>\n<td>前缀单位时间优选路径翻转数</td>\n<td>BMP Loc-RIB</td>\n<td>异常阈值 = 基线 3σ</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>max-prefix 余量</td>\n<td>已用 / 上限</td>\n<td>设备 telemetry</td>\n<td>已用 ≤ 70%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FIB 余量</td>\n<td>已安装路由 / 线卡容量</td>\n<td>设备 telemetry</td>\n<td>已用 ≤ 80%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"可观测性数据面-bmp-流式遥测与告警基线\">可观测性数据面：BMP、流式遥测与告警基线</h2><p>指标采集的成败取决于数据面设计。**BMP（RFC 7854，2016-06）**是标准通道：路由器把每个对等方的 Adj-RIB-In、以及经 **RFC 9069（2022-02）**扩展的 <strong>Loc-RIB</strong>——本地决策过程选出的实际转发路由——推给集中的 BMP 收集器。Loc-RIB 监控是关键补强：没有它，你只能从 Adj-RIB-In 反推选路结果，而这在策略复杂、多路复选时会算错。</p>\n<p>采集有两条纪律。第一，<strong>不要用 SNMP 轮询全表</strong>：轮询百万条路由是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>表规模</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\text{表规模})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">表规模</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的操作，成本与延迟都不可接受；用 BMP 的 Route Monitoring 事件流做增量、Loc-RIB 同步做基准快照才是正确形态。第二，<strong>基数控制</strong>：告警按聚合维度（对等方、市场、前缀族）设置，否则一次泄露会瞬间产生数万条告警，淹没真正的信号。外部基准来自 RouteViews 与 RIPE RIS，APNIC Labs 的 RPKI 测量页与 Cloudflare Radar 的 routing 页提供区域性 ROV 采纳率与泄露/劫持统计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"大促窗口-变更冻结-容量预留与演练节奏\">大促窗口：变更冻结、容量预留与演练节奏</h2><p>跨境电商的运维日历由大促日期反向驱动。一个可复用的节奏：<strong>前 4 周完成最后一轮断链与优雅下线演练</strong>，用实测的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mi>c</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>P</mi><mn>95</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_c^{(P95)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1614em;vertical-align:-0.1166em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5834em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">95</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1166em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 确认备用路径能在目标时间内接管；<strong>前 2 周进入变更冻结</strong>，只允许安全类修复；<strong>前 1 周复核容量</strong>。Anycast 站点在大促期间会因 catchment 漂移出现流量重分布，容量预留要按&quot;单站最大可能 catchment&quot;而非历史均值来算（见 <a href=\"../anycast-traffic-engineering/anycast-model-catchment-ecmp\">Anycast 地址模型、catchment 与 ECMP 边缘分布</a>）。冻结期恰好是补齐<strong>预检自动化</strong>的窗口：把 IRR 生成 prefix-list 的工具（如 <code>bgpq4</code>）、ROA 覆盖检查、max-prefix 余量查询串成一条变更前必跑的流水线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>变更管理</strong>：把一次宣告当成会被四道外部策略裁决的提交——查 IRR/ROA、掩码上限、max-prefix 余量、影响面；用 RFC 8326 的 <code>GRACEFUL_SHUTDOWN</code> 与 RFC 8203 的 shutdown communication 优雅下线；回退靠 <code>commit confirmed</code> 类延迟确认。</li>\n<li><strong>故障演练</strong>：覆盖 RFC 7908 的泄露类型而非只练&quot;温柔&quot;的断链；恢复时间看 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mn>95</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{95}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">95</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 与最大值而非均值；训练用 RFC 5737 保留前缀。</li>\n<li><strong>SLA/容量</strong>：拆成可达率、路径稳定性、收敛时间三族；盯 max-prefix 与 FIB 余量；对 RPKI ROV 的额外开销单独规划。</li>\n<li><strong>数据面</strong>：RFC 7854 BMP 的 Adj-RIB-In 加 RFC 9069 的 Loc-RIB，用事件流而非全表轮询，外部基准交给 RouteViews / RIS / APNIC Labs / Cloudflare Radar。</li>\n<li><strong>大促节奏</strong>：前 4 周演练、前 2 周冻结、前 1 周容量复核；Anycast 容量按单站最大 catchment 预留。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"变更管理、故障演练与路由 SLA/容量度量","id":"变更管理-故障演练与路由-sla-容量度量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：路由运维的三条咬合闭环","id":"核心概念-路由运维的三条咬合闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"路由变更管理：预检、优雅下线与可回滚提交","id":"路由变更管理-预检-优雅下线与可回滚提交"},{"level":2,"text":"故障演练：主动制造收敛、泄露与劫持","id":"故障演练-主动制造收敛-泄露与劫持"},{"level":2,"text":"路由 SLA 与容量度量：把\"网络好\"变成数字","id":"路由-sla-与容量度量-把-网络好-变成数字"},{"level":2,"text":"可观测性数据面：BMP、流式遥测与告警基线","id":"可观测性数据面-bmp-流式遥测与告警基线"},{"level":2,"text":"大促窗口：变更冻结、容量预留与演练节奏","id":"大促窗口-变更冻结-容量预留与演练节奏"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"路由劫持/泄露检测与缓解机制（含 BGPsec）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/bgp-interdomain-routing-anycast-peering-edge-traffic-engineering/operations-security-observability/hijack-leak-detection-mitigation"},"next":null}